  description: 'V5 (visual prefabs): 4:00, no weapons: the Reef Crab miniboss, a
    Kraken Spawn, an Elite Kraken Spawn and the boss (Barnacle King) placed as a
    unit: their models, spawn whirlpools and tornado, health bars and attacks. The
    boss arrival whirlpool shows when the boss is summoned (Tuning Console > Boss
    > Summon). Every visual is a prefab under Assets/_Game/V4/Visuals/Prefabs/<Category>/<id>/
    (plan/v5/VISUAL-PREFABS.md): edit one, then load this again from the Tuning Console.'
